          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Now Sarai Abram's wife bare him no children: and she had an handmaid, an Egyptian, whose name",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.16.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.16.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "was",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "GEN.16.1",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "GEN.16.1"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hagar.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.16.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.16.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 16:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And Sarai said unto Abram, Behold now, the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.16.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.16.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "GEN.16.2",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "GEN.16.2"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "hath restrained me from bearing: I pray thee, go in unto my maid; it may be that I may obtain children by her. And Abram hearkened to the voice of Sarai.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.16.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.16.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.16.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.16.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 16:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And Sarai Abram's wife took Hagar her maid the Egyptian, after Abram had dwelt ten years in the land of Canaan, and gave her to her husband Abram to be his wife.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.16.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.16.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 16:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "¶ And he went in unto Hagar, and she conceived: and when she saw that she had conceived, her mistress was despised in her eyes.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.16.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.16.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 16:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And Sarai said unto Abram, My wrong",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.16.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.16.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "be",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "GEN.16.5",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "GEN.16.5"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "upon thee: I have given my maid into thy bosom; and when she saw that she had conceived, I was despised in her eyes: the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.16.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.16.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "GEN.16.5",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "GEN.16.5"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "judge between me and thee.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.16.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.16.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 16:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But Abram said unto Sarai, Behold, thy maid",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.16.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.16.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "GEN.16.6",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "GEN.16.6"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "in thy hand; do to her as it pleaseth thee. And when Sarai dealt hardly with her, she fled from her face.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.16.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.16.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
