          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And the angel of the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.16.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.16.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "GEN.16.10",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "GEN.16.10"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "said unto her, I will multiply thy seed exceedingly, that it shall not be numbered for multitude.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.16.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.16.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 16:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And the angel of the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.16.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.16.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "GEN.16.11",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "GEN.16.11"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "said unto her, Behold, thou",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.16.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.16.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "art",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "GEN.16.11",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "GEN.16.11"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "with child, and shalt bear a son, and shalt call his name Ishmael; because the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.16.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.16.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "GEN.16.11",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "GEN.16.11"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "hath heard thy affliction.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.16.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.16.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.16.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.16.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 16:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And he will be a wild man; his hand",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.16.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.16.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "will be",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "GEN.16.12",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "GEN.16.12"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "against every man, and every man's hand against him; and he shall dwell in the presence of all his brethren.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.16.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.16.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 16:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And she called the name of the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.16.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.16.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "GEN.16.13",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "GEN.16.13"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "that spake unto her, Thou God seest me: for she said, Have I also here looked after him that seeth me?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.16.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.16.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 16:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wherefore the well was called Beer-lahai-roi; behold,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.16.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.16.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "it is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "GEN.16.14",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "GEN.16.14"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "between Kadesh and Bered.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.16.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.16.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
